{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And unto the herd ran Abraham.</b> It was possible for him to send one of his men to the herd, for in the house of Abraham there were 318 trained men, those born of his household, and he did not wish to, but went himself in person and in his glory at a run, to honor the men, even though he was old and weakened from the commandment of circumcision. Behold, this is testimony to his zeal and his excellence and the generosity of his heart:"], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "Source reads שאברהם, apparently a dittography for של אברהם; rendered as 'of Abraham.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:13:10.115280509Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}